<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2000_7461.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">freundt</unclear>- nachbarlich willig dienst, und was
<lb n="2"/>wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mehr</unclear> ehren <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">leibs</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guets</unclear> vermögend <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuvor</unclear>,
<lb n="3"/>fürsichtigen, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ehrsamen</unclear> und weisen, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">besonders</unclear>
<lb n="4"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gueten</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">freundte</unclear> und lieben <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nachbarn</unclear>.
<lb n="5"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Auf</unclear> dero an uns jüngst abgangen schreiben be-
<lb n="6"/>treffende einen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bevorstehenden</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">landtsknechtischen</unclear>
<lb n="7"/>durchzug, haben wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unsere</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">getreuwen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">liebe</unclear>
<lb n="8"/>eidtgnossen <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-503" cert="medium" resp="#ner">der statt Zürich</orgName>, was <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ihnen</unclear> deß-
<lb n="9"/>halben <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuwüssen</unclear> seyn möchte, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">alßbald</unclear> bey
<lb n="10"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">eignem</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">leuffersbotten</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ersuechen</unclear> lassen, und
<lb n="11"/>von denselben ein <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">antwort</unclear> erhalten, wie
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">e</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">e</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wht</unclear>. auß <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">beyverwarter</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">copey</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuersehen</unclear>.
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Demnach</unclear> auch nit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ermanglet</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mit</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nebet</unclear>
<lb n="14"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unseren</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">getreuwen</unclear> lieben <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nachbarn</unclear> der
<lb n="15"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">usßeren</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">rooden</unclear> des <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">landts</unclear> <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Appenzell</unclear></placeName>, den herren
<lb n="16"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">prelaten</unclear> alhie selbsten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ersuchen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zulassen</unclear>
<lb n="17"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anreden</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zulassen</unclear>, ob und was deßhalb
<lb n="18"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vorhanden</unclear> seyn möchte. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Der</unclear> hat uns <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dise</unclear>
<lb n="19"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ohngefeerliche</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">antwort</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">werden</unclear> lassen.
<lb n="20"/>Von den <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">angedeuten</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sulzischen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zweyen</unclear> regimenten
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sey</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ihme</unclear> noch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">genzlich</unclear> nichts <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fürkomen</unclear>: Aber
<lb n="22"/>wol habe er <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vernomen</unclear>, daß das <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">madruzzisch</unclear>
<lb n="23"/>regiment im <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Maylander</unclear></placeName> gepiet <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">solte</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erzenzt</unclear>
<lb n="24"/>werden, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">welches</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ungefeer</unclear> 2000 <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">landts</unclear>-
<lb n="25"/>knecht <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wurde</unclear> erforderen, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">die</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">selbigen</unclear>
<lb n="26"/>möchten durch ein <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-750" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Eidtgnoschafft</orgName> über den
<lb n="27"/><placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Gotthart</unclear></placeName> ins <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Maylander</unclear> gepiet <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gefüehrt</unclear>
<lb n="28"/>werden, doch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sey</unclear> er umb den <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">pasß</unclear>
<lb n="29"/>noch niemalen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ersuecht</unclear> worden, wann
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2000_7462.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="30"/>er aber ersucht werden <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">solte</unclear>, und die beide <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Ohrt</unclear>
<lb n="31"/><placeName ref="stadtasg-places-70" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Ury</unclear></placeName> und <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-71" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Schweitz</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">darein</unclear> wurden <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verwilligen</unclear>,
<lb n="32"/>so <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mueßte</unclear> er sich seiner mit der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Cron</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-280" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Hispanien</unclear></placeName>
<lb n="33"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">habenden</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">puendtnus</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gemaeß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verhalten</unclear>.
<lb n="34"/>Gleichwol <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">welle</unclear> sein <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">f</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">g</unclear>. nit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ermanglen</unclear>,
<lb n="35"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wan</unclear> solche <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verwilligung</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ervolge</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uns</unclear>
<lb n="36"/>solches nit allein bald <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wissenhafft</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zemachen</unclear>,
<lb n="37"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sonderen</unclear> auch den durchzug der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gestalten</unclear>
<lb n="38"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zebestellen</unclear>, daß darmit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unsere</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">graenzen</unclear>
<lb n="39"/>nit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">beruehrt</unclear> werden, auch dardurch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uns</unclear> und
<lb n="40"/>den <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unseren</unclear> einicher schaden <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">begegnen</unclear> solle.
<lb n="41"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Seyen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">er</unclear> doch von wegen daß gar starckh
<lb n="42"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zwueschet</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-91" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Osterreich</unclear></placeName> und <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-188" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Venedig</placeName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">im</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">friden</unclear>
<lb n="43"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gehandlet</unclear> werde, der hoffnung, es werde
<lb n="44"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">angeregte</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ergentzung</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">des</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Madruzischen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">regi</unclear>-
<lb n="45"/>ments <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vermitten</unclear> bleiben, und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">also</unclear> keiner
<lb n="46"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ferneren</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fuersorg</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">beduerffen</unclear>.
<lb n="47"/>Welches alles <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wht</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wir</unclear> nit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wellen</unclear>
<lb n="48"/>verhalten, und was uns deßhalb <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">weiter</unclear>
<lb n="49"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fuerkomt</unclear>, sol ihnen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ebenmessig</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unver</unclear>-
<lb n="50"/>halten bleiben, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wie</unclear> dann ihnen in
<lb n="51"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dem</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">anderem</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zeerweisen</unclear>, alles das
<lb n="52"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">jehinge</unclear>, was zu <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gueter</unclear> correspondentz,
<lb n="53"/>und ihnen zu annemlichem gefallen
<lb n="54"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">reicht</unclear>, und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">befuerderlich</unclear> ist, bleiben wir
<lb n="55"/>so geneigt, als wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Gott</unclear> bitten, er uns
<lb n="56"/>beiderseits bey <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guetem</unclear> wolstand <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ferner</unclear>
<lb n="57"/>welle erhalten. Datum den <origDate when="1616-06-13" resp="#ner">3. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">13</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">junij</unclear>
<lb n="58"/>1616</origDate>.
